{
 "format": "dreading-material-table",
 "version": 1,
 "notes": "One shared PBR atlas for generated buildings, site props and terrain. UV origin is bottom-left (Blender convention). Box-project each face at uvMetres metres per UV unit, wrap the fractional part into the tile rect. Final colour = albedo * tint (tint is linear RGB, applied as vertex colour at runtime).",
 "uvMetres": 2.0,
